# Renderer & shared types

## API surface

- Call **`window.scissor`** only (no raw `ipcRenderer` in renderer). It is injected by preload.
- Import domain types from **`../../shared/types`** (path depends on file depth under `src/renderer/`).

## Types & defaults

- **`TransformOptions`** and related types live in `src/shared/types.ts`. When adding fields:
  - Extend the type there.
  - Update **`DEFAULT_OPTS`** (or equivalent) in the UI.
  - Update **ffmpeg** construction in `src/main/ffmpeg-utils.ts` if the option affects export.

## UI code

- Functional components + hooks; strict TS (`noEmit` + `strict` in root `tsconfig.json`).
- Match existing patterns in `App.tsx` for state, status enums, and ffmpeg readiness checks.
